# Designing Task Page 🎨

## What is a Task Page?
A **Task Page** is used to display and manage tasks in a web application.

### Features
- ➕ Add a new task
- 📋 View all tasks
- ✏️ Edit a task
- 🗑️ Delete a task
- ✅ Mark a task as completed

### Example (HTML)

```html
<h2>My Tasks</h2>

<button>Add Task</button>

<ul>
    <li>Complete Django Project</li>
    <li>Practice Python</li>
</ul>
```

## Key Points
- Keep the UI **simple and responsive**.
- Use **Bootstrap** for styling.
- Provide **Edit**, **Delete**, and **Complete** buttons for each task.
- Display tasks in a clean list or table............................
